# Milestone: M3 (activated v0.8.0 — persistent loader strand)
# Covers: ',' separator fire-and-forget; detached strand runs concurrently
#         with main strand.
#
# Trailing comma (42,) is the no-crash regression from the legacy fixture
# (originally "this used to segfault").  Live concurrency test demonstrates
# fire-and-forget: the detached arm writes x=1 AFTER the main arm reads x=0,
# so the main result is x+10=10; the write becomes visible on the next step.
#
# sleep() / echo() are not registered at this milestone (deferred T43); the
# timing-ordering test from the legacy fixture is replaced by cross-step
# observation.

42,
[00000000] 42

var x = 0
(Realm.x = 1) , (Realm.x + 10)
Realm.x
[00000001] 0
[00000002] 10
[00000003] 1
